msgstr "Italijanski avioportolanski VFR karto"

#, no-c-format
msgid "German DFS VFR Chart"
msgstr "Nemški DFS VFR karto"

#, no-c-format
msgid "French SIA VFR Chart"
msgstr "Francoski SIA VFR karto"

#, no-c-format
msgid "High Contrast"
msgstr "Visoki kontrast"

#, no-c-format
msgid "High Contrast low lands"
msgstr "Visoki kontrast nizke poljane"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Very low lands"
msgstr "Precej nizke poljane"

msgid "Terrain colors"
msgstr "Barve topografije"

msgid "Defines the color ramp used in terrain rendering."
msgstr "Definira barvni rampo uporabljeno pri prikazu topografije."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Sun"
msgstr "Sunce"

msgid "Slope shading"
msgstr "Vključevanje zgoravajočih linij"

msgid "Terrain contrast"
msgstr "Kontrast topografije"

msgid "Defines the amount of Phong shading in the terrain rendering. Use large values to emphasise terrain slope, smaller values if flying in steep mountains."
msgstr "Definira količino Phongovga zgoravljanja pri prikazu topografije. Uporabite velike vrednosti, da poudarite stopnjo površine, malte če letate v visokih planinskih območjih."

msgid "Terrain brightness"
msgstr "Širina topografije"

msgid "Defines the brightness (whiteness) of the terrain rendering. This controls the average illumination of the terrain."
msgstr "Definira sirino (sivino) prikazane topografije. To upravlja srednjo osvetlitev površine."

msgid "Contours"
msgstr "Konture"

msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Nastavitev"

msgid "Load a set of units."
msgstr "Naloži skupino enot."

msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Vlastni"

msgid "My individual set of units."
msgstr "Moje zasebna naprava za enote."

#, no-c-format
msgid "knots"
msgstr "uzlišča"

msgid "Aircraft/Wind speed"
msgstr "Letalska/vetra hitrost"

msgid ""
"Units used for airspeed and ground speed. A separate unit is available for "
"task speeds."
msgstr ""
"Enote uporabljene za letalsko in podletno hitrost. Dopolnita enota je na "
"voljo za hitrosti nalog."

msgid ""
"Units used for horizontal distances e.g. range to waypoint, distance to go."
msgstr ""
"Enote uporabljene za horizontalne razdalje, npr. razdalja do točke poti, "
"preostala razpon."

msgid "Lift"
msgstr "Podpora"

msgid "Units used for vertical speeds (variometer)."
msgstr "Enote uporabljene za vertikalne hitrosti (variometer)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "feet"
msgstr "stopinj"

#, no-c-format
msgid "meters"
msgstr "metri"

msgid "Units used for altitude and heights."
msgstr "Enote uporabljene za višine in visinske vrednosti."

msgid "Units used for temperature."
msgstr "Enote uporabljene za temperature."

msgid "Units used for task speeds."
msgstr "Enote uporabljene za nalozne hitrosti."

msgid "Units used for pressures."
msgstr "Enote uporabljene za tlake."

msgid "Units used for mass."
msgstr "Enote uporabljene za maso."

msgid "Units used for wing loading."
msgstr "Enote uporabljene za lepenje čepa."

msgid "Lat./Lon."
msgstr "Srednja širina/Dežna dolgina"

msgid "Units used for latitude and longitude."
msgstr "Enote uporabljene za srednjo širino in dežno dolžino."

msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "Informacija"

msgid "Unit used for rotation."
msgstr "Enota za rotacijo."

#, no-c-format
msgid "UTC offset"
msgstr "UTC odstevanje"

msgid ""
"The UTC offset field allows the UTC local time offset to be specified. The "
"local time is displayed below in order to make it easier to verify the "
"correct offset has been entered."
msgstr ""
"Polje za UTC odstevanje omogoča določbo razlike med lokalno časom in UTC-om. "
"Prikazan je lokalni čas, da bo bilo enostavnejše preveriti pravilnost "
"vnesenega odstevanja."

msgid "Use GPS time"
msgstr "Uporaba GPS časa"

msgid ""
"If enabled sets the clock of the computer to the GPS time once a fix is set. "
"This is only necessary if your computer does not have a real-time clock with "
"battery backup or your computer frequently runs out of battery power or "
"otherwise loses time."
msgstr ""
"Če je omogočeno, nastavi časovnik računalnika na GPS čas, ko je postavljen "
"fix. To je potrebno le, če vaš računalek ni zapretnega časovnika s baterijo "
"ali če vaš računalek čeče baterijo ali drugače izgubi čas."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Celotno ime"

#, no-c-format
msgid "The full name of each waypoint is displayed."
msgstr "Celotno ime vsake točke poti je prikazano."

#, no-c-format
msgid "First word of name"
msgstr "Prvo besedilo imena"

#, no-c-format
msgid "The first word of the waypoint name is displayed."
msgstr "Prva beseda v imenu točke poti je prikazana."

#, no-c-format
msgid "First 3 letters"
msgstr "Prve tri pismenice"

#, no-c-format
msgid "The first 3 letters of the waypoint name are displayed."
msgstr "Prve tri pismenice v imenu točke poti so prikazane."

#, no-c-format
msgid "First 5 letters"
msgstr "Prve pet pismenice"

#, no-c-format
msgid "The first 5 letters of the waypoint name are displayed."
msgstr "Prve pet pismenice v imenu točke poti so prikazane."

#, no-c-format
msgid "No waypoint name is displayed."
msgstr "Ime točke poti ni prikazano."

#, no-c-format
msgid "The short name of each waypoint is displayed. If unavailable, the first five letters of the full name are displayed."
msgstr "Kratko ime vsake točke poti je prikazano. Če ni na voljo, so prikazane prve pet pismenice celotnega imena."

msgid "Label format"
msgstr "Format oznake"

msgid "Determines how labels are displayed with each waypoint"
msgstr "Odreduje, kako so oznake prikazane z vsako točko poti"

#, no-c-format
msgid "No arrival height is displayed."
msgstr "Nista prikazana dosežna višina."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight glide"
msgstr "Pravilni drs"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight glide arrival height (no terrain is considered)."
msgstr "Dosežna višina za pravilni drs (brez razmatranja topografije)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terrain avoidance glide"
msgstr "Drs za izogibanje terenu"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Arrival height considering terrain avoidance. Requires \"Reach mode: Turning\" in \"Glide Computer > Route\" settings."
msgstr "Dosegov visina s obzirom na spodnje prepreke. Pohtitev: \"Način delovanja: Obrat\" v nastavitvah \"Drsno računalo > Pot\"."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight & terrain glide"
msgstr "Pravokotni drs z upoštevanjem spodnjih preprek"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Both arrival heights are displayed. Requires \"Reach mode: Turning\" in \"Glide Computer > Route\" settings."
msgstr "Obe dosegov so prikazani. Pohtitev: \"Način delovanja: Obrat\" v nastavitvah \"Drsno računalo > Pot\"."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Required GR & terrain glide"
msgstr "Povprečni doseg in drs s upoštevanjem spodnjih preprek"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Both Required glide ratio and terrain avoidance height are displayed. Requires \"Reach mode: Turning\" in \"Glide Computer > Route\" settings."
msgstr "Obe povprečni doseg in visina za izhod iz zračnega prostora so prikazane. Pohtitev: \"Način delovanja: Obrat\" v nastavitvah \"Drsno računalo > Pot\"."

msgid "Determines how arrival height is displayed in waypoint labels"
msgstr "Odreduje, kako se doseg prikazuje v oznakah potnih točk"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Rounded rectangle"
msgstr "Okrogli pravokotnik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Outlined"
msgstr "Prenik"

msgid "Label style"
msgstr "Stil oznake"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task waypoints & airfields"
msgstr "Točke nalage in letališča"

#, no-c-format
msgid "All waypoints part of a task and all airfields will be displayed."
msgstr "Vse točke, delitev nalage in vse letališča bodo prikazane."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task waypoints & landables"
msgstr "Točke nalage in pristanki"

#, no-c-format
msgid "All waypoints part of a task and all landables will be displayed."
msgstr "Vse točke, delitev nalage in vse pristanke bodo prikazane."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task waypoints"
msgstr "Točke nalage"

#, no-c-format
msgid "All waypoints part of a task will be displayed."
msgstr "Vse točke, delitev nalage bodo prikazane."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Purple circle"
msgstr "Plavajoca kroglica"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airports and outlanding fields are displayed as purple circles. If the waypoint is reachable a bigger green circle is added behind the purple one. If the waypoint is blocked by a mountain the green circle will be red instead."
msgstr "Letališča in pristanki izven letališča so prikazana kot plavajoca kroglice. Če je točka dosežljiva, se za njo dodate večja zeleno kroglico. Če je točka blokirana gorskim, se barva spremeni v rdečo."

#, no-c-format
msgid "B/W"
msgstr "Svetloško"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airports and outlanding fields are displayed in white/grey. If the waypoint is reachable the color is changed to green. If the waypoint is blocked by a mountain the color is changed to red instead."
msgstr "Letališča in pristanki izven letališča so prikazana v beli/sivem. Če je točka dosežljiva, se barva spremeni v zeleno. Če je točka blokirana gorskim, se barva spremeni v rdečo."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Traffic lights"
msgstr "Svetloški svetlače"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airports and outlanding fields are displayed in the colors of a traffic light. Green if reachable, Orange if blocked by mountain and red if not reachable at all."
msgstr "Letalske trke in pristanke so prikazane barvami trgovinskega svetla. Zeleno, če je dosegljivo, oranzno, če je zahodišči zabrano gorskim gozdom, in crveno, če ni dosegljivo."

msgid "Landable symbols"
msgstr "Pripažljive simbole"

msgid "Three styles are available: Purple circles (WinPilot style), a high contrast (monochrome) style, or orange. The rendering differs for landable field and airport. All styles mark the waypoints within reach green."
msgstr "Dostopne oblike so: Purplni krogi (WinPilot oblika), visok kontrast (monokrom) ali oranzni. Prikaz se razlikuje za pripažljive trke in letalske trke. Vse oblike označijo točke poti, ki so dosegljive z zelenimi."

msgid "Detailed landables"
msgstr "Podrobnosti o pripažljivih trkah"

msgid ""
"[Off] Display fixed icons for landables.\n"
"[On] Show landables with variable information like runway length and heading."
msgstr "[Izključen] Prikaz stalnih ikon za pripažljive trke."

msgid "Landable size"
msgstr "Velikost pripažljivih trkov"

msgid "A percentage to select the size landables are displayed on the map."
msgstr "Odstotek za izbiro velikosti, s katero so prikazani pripažljivi trki na karti."

msgid "Scale runway length"
msgstr "Skaliranje dolžine letališčne poti"

msgid ""
"[Off] Display fixed length for runways.\n"
"[On] Scale displayed runway length based on real length."
msgstr "[Izključen] Prikaz stalne dolžine letališčnih poti."

msgid "Show thermal locations downloaded from Thermal Information Map (thermalmap.info)."
msgstr "Prikaži lokacije termik, ki jih je preneslo Thermal Information Map (thermalmap.info)."

msgid "Allow download of declared tasks from Weglide in the Task Manager."
msgstr "Dozvoli prenematan obveščenih nalog iz WeGlide v upravljalniku naloga."

msgid "Automatic Upload"
msgstr "Samodejni prenos"

msgid ""
"Asks whether to upload flight to Weglide, after flight is downloaded from "
"external logger."
msgstr ""
"Zahteva, ali naj se let je naloži na WeGlide, po tem ko je prebrano iz "
"zunanje zaporednice podatkov."

msgid "Take this from your WeGlide Profile. Or set to 0 if not used."
msgstr ""
"Preberi to iz vašega profilja WeGlide. Ali nastavite na 0, če ni uporabljen."

msgid "Pilot date of birth"
msgstr "Datum rojstva letca"

msgid "Radius of the OZ cylinder."
msgstr "Polmer cilindra OZ."

msgid "Width of the start/finish gate."
msgstr "Širina začetnega/končnega vrata."

msgid "Radius of the OZ sector."
msgstr "Polmer sektorja OZ."

msgid "Start radial"
msgstr "Začetna radiala"

msgid "Start radial of the OZ area"
msgstr "Začetna radiala oblasti OZ"

msgid "Finish radial"
msgstr "Končna radiala"

msgid "Finish radial of the OZ area"
msgstr "Končna radiala oblasti OZ"

msgid "Inner radius"
msgstr "Vnena polmer"

msgid "Inner radius of the OZ sector."
msgstr "Vnena polmer sektorja OZ."

msgid "Angle"
msgstr "Kot"

msgid "Turn Points"
msgstr "Obratne točke"

msgid "Task Manager"
msgstr "Upravljalec naloge"

msgid "Validation Errors"
msgstr "Napaki pri potrditvi"

msgid ""
"Task not valid. Changes will be lost.\n"
"Continue?"
msgstr "Naloga ni veljavna. Spremenila bodo izgubljene."

msgid "Task has been modified"
msgstr "Naloga je bil spremenjen"

msgid "Task unchanged"
