msgid ""
"# Preflight Checks\n"
"\n"
"Before each flight, verify:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Plane & Polar** - Correct aircraft and polar selected. [Config > Plane](xcsoar://config/planes)\n"
"\n"
"2. **Flight parameters** - Wing loading, bugs, QNH, max temperature. [Info > Flight](xcsoar://dialog/flight)\n"
"\n"
"3. **Wind** - Set wind manually or enable auto wind. [Info > Wind](xcsoar://dialog/wind)\n"
"\n"
"4. **Task** - Create a task for navigation guidance. [Nav > Task Manager](xcsoar://dialog/task)"
msgstr ""
"# Preverjanja pred letom\n"
"\n"
"Pred vsakim poletom preverite:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Plane & Polar** - izbrano pravilno letalo in pola. [Konfiguracija > Letalo](xcsoar://config/planes)\n"
"\n"
"2. **Parametri leta** - Obremenitev krila, hrošči, QNH, maksimalna temperatura. [Informacije > Let](xcsoar://dialog/flight)\n"
"\n"
"3. **Veter** - Ročno nastavite veter ali omogočite samodejni veter. [Informacije > Veter](xcsoar://dialog/wind)\n"
"\n"
"4. **Opravilo** - Ustvarite opravilo za navigacijsko vodenje. [Nav > Upravitelj opravil](xcsoar://dialog/task)"

msgid ""
"# After Your Flight\n"
"\n"
"1. **Download logs** - Retrieve flight logs from your FLARM or logger device. [Config > Devices](xcsoar://config/devices)\n"
"\n"
"2. **Analysis** - Review your flight statistics. [Info > Analysis](xcsoar://dialog/analysis)\n"
"\n"
"3. **Status** - Check flight timing and statistics. [Info > Status](xcsoar://dialog/status)\n"
"\n"
"4. **Upload** - Upload to WeGlide directly from XCSoar. Configure your WeGlide User ID in [Config > System > WeGlide](xcsoar://config/weglide)"
msgstr ""
"# Po vašem letu\n"
"\n"
"1. **Prenos dnevnikov** - Pridobite dnevnike letov iz vašega FLARM ali naprave za beleženje. [Konfiguracija > Naprave](xcsoar://config/devices)\n"
"\n"
"2. **Analiza** - Preglejte statistiko svojih letov. [Informacije > Analiza](xcsoar://dialog/analysis)\n"
"\n"
"3. **Status** - Preverite čas letenja in statistiko. [Informacije > Stanje](xcsoar://dialog/status)\n"
"\n"
"4. **Naloži** - Naložite v WeGlide neposredno iz XCSoar. Konfigurirajte svoj ID uporabnika WeGlide v [Konfiguracija > Sistem > WeGlide](xcsoar://config/weglide)"

msgid ""
"![](resource:IDB_LOCATION_PIN)\n"
"\n"
"# Location Access\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar collects location data to enable flight navigation, thermal mapping, and flight logging even when the app is closed or not in use.\n"
"\n"
"- **GPS Position** - Real-time navigation and glide computer\n"
"- **Background Location** - Continuous flight recording when the screen is off or another app is in the foreground\n"
"- **Foreground Service** - Keeps GPS active during your flight\n"
"\n"
"Your location data is stored locally on your device. It is not shared unless you explicitly enable tracking in [Config > Tracking](xcsoar://config/tracking).\n"
"\n"
"[Privacy Policy](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/blob/master/PRIVACY.md)"
msgstr ""
"![](resource:IDB_LOCATION_PIN)\n"
"\n"
"# Dostop do lokacije\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar zbira podatke o lokaciji, da omogoči navigacijo letov, termično kartiranje in beleženje letov, tudi ko je aplikacija zaprta ali ni v uporabi.\n"
"\n"
"- **Položaj GPS** - Navigacija v realnem času in drsni računalnik\n"
"- **Lokacija v ozadju** - Neprekinjeno snemanje leta, ko je zaslon izklopljen ali je v ospredju druga aplikacija\n"
"- **Foreground Service** - Ohranja GPS aktiven med vašim letom\n"
"\n"
"Podatki o vaši lokaciji so shranjeni lokalno v vaši napravi. Ni v skupni rabi, razen če izrecno omogočite sledenje v [Konfiguracija > Sledenje](xcsoar://config/tracking).\n"
"\n"
"[Politika zasebnosti](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/blob/master/PRIVACY.md)"

msgid ""
"![](resource:IDB_NOTIFICATION_BELL)\n"
"\n"
"# Notifications\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar needs notification permission to maintain a persistent notification while recording your flight. This notification is required by Android for background operation and provides a quick way to return to the app.\n"
"\n"
"Without this permission, Android may stop flight recording when the app is in the background."
msgstr ""
"![](resource:IDB_NOTIFICATION_BELL)\n"
"\n"
"# Obvestila\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar potrebuje dovoljenje za obveščanje, da ohrani stalno obvestilo med snemanjem vašega leta. To obvestilo zahteva Android za delovanje v ozadju in omogoča hiter način vrnitve v aplikacijo.\n"
"\n"
"Brez tega dovoljenja lahko Android ustavi snemanje leta, ko je aplikacija v ozadju."

msgid ""
"# XCSoar Cloud\n"
"\n"
"The XCSoar project offers a service that allows sharing thermal and wave locations with other pilots in real time.\n"
"\n"
"If you participate, your **position**, **thermal/wave locations** and other weather data will be transmitted to the XCSoar Cloud server.\n"
"\n"
"You can change this at any time in [Config > Tracking](xcsoar://config/tracking)."
msgstr ""
"# XCSoar Cloud\n"
"\n"
"Projekt XCSoar ponuja storitev, ki omogoča izmenjavo termalnih in valovnih lokacij z drugimi piloti v realnem času.\n"
"\n"
"Če sodelujete, bodo vaš **položaj**, **toplotne/valovne lokacije** in drugi vremenski podatki poslani v strežnik XCSoar Cloud.\n"
"\n"
"To lahko kadar koli spremenite v [Konfiguracija > Sledenje](xcsoar://config/tracking)."

