"since the top of the last thermal. Negative values indicate climbing cruise "
"(height gain since leaving the last thermal). If the vertical speed is close "
"to zero, the displayed value is '---'."
msgstr ""
"Razdalja od vrha zadnjega dviganja deljena z izgubljeno višino od zadnjega "
"dviganja. Negativne vrednosti pomenijo pridobivanje višine med križarjenjem. "
"Če je vertikalna hitrost blizu 0, je prikazana vrednost '---'."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed ground"
msgstr "Hitrost glede na tla"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V GND"
msgstr "V Tla"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ground speed measured by the GPS. The small value shows the head or tail "
"wind difference to TAS for the current vector. If this InfoBox is active in "
"simulation mode, pressing the up and down arrows adjusts the speed, and left "
"and right turn the glider."
msgstr ""
"Hitrost, glede na tla, merjena z GPS. V načinu simulacije lahko s pritiskom "
"na puščici gor/dol prilagodimo vrednost, puščici levo/desno obračata letalo."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Last thermal average"
msgstr "Povprečje zadnjega dviganja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TL Avg"
msgstr "ZD povp"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Total altitude gain/loss in the last thermal divided by the time spent "
"circling."
msgstr ""
"Celotna višina pridobljena/izgubljena v zadnjem dviganju deljena z časom, "
"porabljenim za kroženje."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Last thermal gain"
msgstr "Dobitek višine zadnjega dviganja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TL Gain"
msgstr "+ viš. dvg"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Total altitude gain/loss in the last thermal. The number in smaller font "
"reflects the overall climb rate for the last thermal."
msgstr ""
"Celotna višina pridobljena/izgubljena v zadnjem dviganju deljena z časom, "
"porabljenim za kroženje."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Last thermal duration"
msgstr "Trajanje zadnjega dviganja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TL duration"
msgstr "Čas dviganja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time spent circling in the last thermal."
msgstr "Čas porabljen s kroženjem v zadnjem dviganju."

#, no-c-format
msgid "MacCready setting"
msgstr "Nastavitev MacCready"

#, no-c-format
msgid "MC"
msgstr "MC"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Current MacCready setting and mode (manual or auto). (Touch-screen/PC only) "
"When this InfoBox is active, use the up/down cursor keys to adjust the "
"MacCready setting."
msgstr ""
"Trenutna MacCready nastavitev in trenutni MacCready način (ročni ali "
"atomatski). N načinu simulacije lahko na PC/napravah z zaslonom na dotik "
"spreminjaš vrednosti z uporabo gor/dol puščic."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next distance"
msgstr "Naslednja razdalja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP Dist"
msgstr "WP Razd"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Distance to the currently selected waypoint. For AAT tasks, this is the "
"distance to the target within the AAT sector."
msgstr ""
"Razdalja do trenutno izbrane točke. Za naloge AAT je to točka do izbrane "
"tarče v območju AAT."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next altitude difference"
msgstr "Naslednja razlika višine"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP AltD"
msgstr "T V Raz"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Arrival altitude at the next waypoint relative to the safety arrival height. "
"For AAT tasks, the target within the AAT sector is used."
msgstr ""
"Višina ob prihodu na naslednjo obratno točko relativna na varnostno višino. "
"Za AAT naloge je v uporabi tarčna točka v AAT območju."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next altitude required"
msgstr "Naslednja potrebna višina"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP AltR"
msgstr "T Viš Pot"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additional altitude required to reach the next turn point. For AAT tasks, "
"the target within the AAT sector is used."
msgstr ""
"Dodatna višina, potrebna za doseg naslednje obratne točke. Za AAT naloge se "
"uporabi tarčna točka v AAT sektorju."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next waypoint"
msgstr "Naslednja točka"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next WP"
msgstr "T nas"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Name of the currently selected turn point. When this InfoBox is active, "
"using the up/down cursor keys selects the next/previous waypoint in the "
"task. (Touch-screen/PC only) Pressing the enter cursor key brings up the "
"Airfields/waypoint details."
msgstr ""
"Ime trenutno izbranega obratne točke. Ko je ta InfoBox aktivna, uporaba "
"tipkov niza/oništega za izbiro izbere naslednjega/prejšnjega potne točke v "
"nalogi. (Tipkovnica/tipkovniški zaslon le) Naspišitev tipke enter izvede "
"prikaz podrobnosti letališča/potne točke."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final altitude difference"
msgstr "Končna razlika višine"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin AltD"
msgstr "Konč ViR"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Arrival altitude at the final task turn point relative to the safety arrival "
"height."
msgstr "Višina prihoda na končni točki naloge glede na varnostno višino."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final altitude required"
msgstr "Končna potrebna višina"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin AltR"
msgstr "Viš Kon"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional altitude required to finish the task."
msgstr "Dodatna višina, potrebna za uspešen zaključek naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed task average"
msgstr "Povprečna hitrost na nalogi"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V Task Avg"
msgstr "PovpHitrNal"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Average cross-country speed while on current task, not compensated for "
"altitude."
msgstr "Povprečna hitrost na trenutni nalogi, brez kompenzacije višine."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final distance"
msgstr "Razdalja do cilja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin Dist"
msgstr "Fin Raz"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance to finish around remaining turn points."
msgstr "Razdalja do cilja okoli preostalih obratnih točk."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terrain elevation"
msgstr "Višina terena"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terr Elev"
msgstr "Viš Teren"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Elevation of the terrain above mean sea level, obtained from the terrain "
"file at the current GPS location."
msgstr ""
"To je višina terena nad morsko gladino, pridobljena iz datoteke s podatki o "
"terenu na trenutni GPS poziciji."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal average"
msgstr "Povprečje dviganja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC Avg"
msgstr "DvgPovp"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Altitude gained/lost in the current thermal, divided by time spent "
"thermalling."
msgstr ""
"Višina, pridobljena v trenutnem dviganju, deljena z časom, porabljenim v "
"kroženju."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal gain"
msgstr "Dobitek višine"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC Gain"
msgstr "+Viš"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altitude gained/lost in the current thermal."
msgstr "Višina, pridobljena/izgubljena v trenutnem dviganju."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Magnetic track reported by the GPS. (Touch-screen/PC only) If this InfoBox "
"is active in simulation mode, pressing the up/down arrows adjusts the track."
msgstr ""
"Magnetna traga, ki jo odraža GPS. (Tipkovnica/tipkovniški zaslon le) Ko je "
"ta InfoBox aktivna v reprezentaciji, uporaba tipkov številnih streličk "
"izmenično izbere nastavitve, a zaustavitev vrednosti s pomočjo tipkov leve/"
"desne streličke."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous vertical speed, as reported by the GPS, or the intelligent "
"vario total energy vario value if connected to one."
msgstr ""
"Okolišnja hitrost, kot jo odraža GPS, ali inteligentni variometer, če je "
"povezan z totalno energijsko varijometrom."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind speed"
msgstr "Hitrost vetra"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind speed estimated by XCSoar. Manual adjustment is possible with the connected InfoBox dialogue. Pressing the up/down cursor keys to cycle through settings, adjust the values with left/right cursor keys."
msgstr "Ocena hitrosti vetra od strani XCSoar. Možna je ručna justacija s pomočjo InfoBox dialoga. Uporaba tipkov številnih streličk izmenično izbere nastavitve, a zaustavitev vrednosti s pomočjo tipkov leve/desne streličke."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind bearing"
msgstr "Smer vetra"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wind bearing estimated by XCSoar. Manual adjustment is possible with the "
"connected InfoBox dialogue. Pressing the up/down cursor keys to cycle "
"through settings, adjust the values with left/right cursor keys."
msgstr ""
"Ocena smeri vetra od strani XCSoar. Možna je ručna justacija s pomočjo "
"InfoBox dialoga. Uporaba tipkov številnih streličk izmenično izbere "
"nastavitve, a zaustavitev vrednosti s pomočjo tipkov leve/desne streličke."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT time"
msgstr "Čas AAT"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Time"
msgstr "Čas AAT"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assigned Area Task time remaining. Goes red when time remaining has expired."
msgstr ""
"Preostalih časa v nadzorovanim področjema naloge. Postane crven, ko "
"preostalih časa ni več."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT max. distance "
msgstr "AAT maksimalna razdalja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Dmax"
msgstr "AAT Dmax"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigned Area Task maximum distance possible for remainder of task."
msgstr "Maksimalna razponi v nadzorovanih področjih za preostanek naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT min. distance"
msgstr "AAT najmanjša razdalja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Dmin"
msgstr "AAT Dmin"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigned Area Task minimum distance possible for remainder of task."
msgstr "Nastavljena območna naloga minimum razdalja za preostal del naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT speed max. distance"
msgstr "AAT hitrost maksimalna razdalja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Vmax"
msgstr "AAT Vmaks"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assigned Area Task average speed achievable if flying maximum possible "
"distance remaining in minimum AAT time."
msgstr ""
"Nastavljena območna naloga povprečna hitrost, če se leti največjo možno "
"razdaljo v minimalni času AAT."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT speed min. distance"
msgstr "AAT hitrost najmanjša razdalja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Vmin"
msgstr "AAT Vmin"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assigned Area Task average speed achievable if flying minimum possible "
"distance remaining in minimum AAT time."
msgstr ""
"Nastavljena območna naloga povprečna hitrost, če se leti najmanjšo možno "
"razdaljo v minimalni času AAT."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airspeed IAS"
msgstr "Hitrost ASI"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V IAS"
msgstr "V ASI"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Indicated Airspeed reported by a supported external intelligent vario."
msgstr "Indikirana hitrost zraka iz podporevnega varija."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Barometric altitude"
msgstr "Barometrična višina"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alt Baro"
msgstr "Visina barometrična"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Barometric altitude obtained from a device equipped with a pressure sensor."
msgstr "Barometrična višina, prejeta od naprtne senzorice."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed MacCready"
msgstr "Hitrost MacCready"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V MC"
msgstr "V MC"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"MacCready speed-to-fly for optimal flight to the next waypoint. In cruise "
"flight mode, this speed-to-fly is calculated for maintaining altitude. In "
"final glide mode, this speed-to-fly is calculated for descent."
msgstr ""
"MacCready hitrost za let do naslednjega točka poti za optimizirano leti. V "
"načinu leta v državi je ta hitrost za let izračunana za pohajanje na višini. "
"V načinu končnega drsa je ta hitrost za let izračunana za pad."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Percentage climb"
msgstr "Odstotek vzlet"

#, no-c-format
msgid "% Climb"
msgstr "% Climb"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Percentage of time spent in climb mode. These statistics are reset upon "
"starting the task."
msgstr ""
"Odstotek časa v načinu vzletanja. Te statistike se ponovno zacnejo pri "
"začetku naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Flight duration"
msgstr "Trajanje leta"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Flt Duration"
msgstr "Traj. leta"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time elapsed since takeoff was detected."
msgstr "Vrijeme koje je prošlo od detekcije vzletnega stanja."

#, no-c-format
msgid "G load"
msgstr "G-odsek"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Magnitude of G loading reported by a supported external intelligent vario. "
"This value is negative for pitch-down manoeuvres."
msgstr ""
"Magnituda G-odseka, ki ga izraža podprta vnosna varijometrijska sredstva. "
"Vrednost je negativna za manevre z nadzidanjem."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next GR"
msgstr "Nastavni DRS"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP GR"
msgstr "WP DRS"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Required glide ratio over ground to reach the next waypoint, given by the "
"distance to the next waypoint divided by the height required to arrive at "
"the safety arrival height."
msgstr ""
"Zahtevano drsno razmerje po zemlji, da bi se doseglo naslednjo točko poti, "
"določeno kot razdalja do nasledne točke podijeljena s visino potrebnim za "
"dosego varnostnega položaja."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time local"
msgstr "Lokalno vrijeme"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time loc"
msgstr "Vrijeme loc"

#, no-c-format
msgid "GPS time expressed in local time zone."
msgstr "GPS vrijeme izrazeno u lokalnom vremenskom razdoblju."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time UTC"
msgstr "UTC vrijeme"

#, no-c-format
msgid "GPS time expressed in UTC."
msgstr "GPS vrijeme izrazeno u UTC."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task time to go"
msgstr "Vrijeme do kraja naloge"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin ETE"
msgstr "Točka poti ET"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Estimated time required to complete task, assuming performance of ideal "
"MacCready cruise/climb cycle."
msgstr ""
"Ocijenjeno vrijeme potrebno za završetek naloge, pretpostavljajući idealni "
"MacCready letni ciklus."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next time to go"
msgstr "Nastavni čas do kraja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP ETE"
msgstr "Točka poti ETE"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Estimated time required to reach next waypoint, assuming performance of "
"ideal MacCready cruise/climb cycle."
msgstr ""
"Ocena časovnega potrebnega do naslednjega točke, predpostavljeno idealno "
"MacCready ciklus leta/poniščevanja."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed dolphin"
msgstr "Hitrost dolfinja"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous MacCready speed-to-fly, making use of netto vario calculations "
"to determine dolphin cruise speed on the glider's current track. In cruise "
"flight mode, this speed-to-fly is calculated for maintaining altitude. In "
"final glide mode, this speed-to-fly is calculated for descent. In climb "
"mode, this switches to the speed for minimum sink at the current load factor "
"(if an accelerometer is connected). When Block mode speed-to-fly is "
"selected, this InfoBox displays the MacCready speed."
msgstr ""
"Srednji hitrost dolfinja MacCready, ki uporablja izračune netto varija za "
"odrejanje dolfinjske hitrosti na trenutni poti letala. V režimu leta je ta "
"hitrost dolfinja za ohranjanje višine. V režimu končnega drsa je ta hitrost "
"dolfinja za opustoščanje. V režimu poniščevanja se pretvori v hitrost za "
"minimum sink na trenutnem faktorju nabočnosti (če je povezan akcelerometer). "
"Ko je izbrana hitrost dolfinja bloka, prikazuje se MacCready hitrost."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Netto vario"
msgstr "Neto variometer"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Netto"
msgstr "Netno"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous vertical speed of air-mass, equal to vario value less the "
"glider's estimated sink rate. Best used if airspeed, accelerometers and "
"vario are connected, otherwise calculations are based on GPS measurements "
"and wind estimates."
msgstr ""
"Srednji vertikalni hitrost zraka, enak razliki med varijom in oceno "
"poniščevanja letala. Najbolje uporabljeno, če so povezani hitri variometer, "
"hitrosti vzduha in akcelerometeri, drugače so izračuni založeni na merjenjih "
"GPS-a in ocenah vetra."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task arrival time"
msgstr "Čas prihodka naloge"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin ETA"
msgstr "Konečna ETA"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Estimated arrival local time at task completion, assuming performance of "
"ideal MacCready cruise/climb cycle."
msgstr ""
"Ocena lokalne časa prihodka na koncu nalogo, predpostavljeno idealno "
"MacCready ciklus leta/poniščevanja."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next arrival time"
msgstr "Naslednji čas prihodka"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP ETA"
msgstr "TOČKA POTI ETA"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Estimated arrival local time at next waypoint, assuming performance of ideal "
"MacCready cruise/climb cycle."
msgstr ""
"Ocena lokalne časa prihodka naslednjega točke, predpostavljeno idealno "
"MacCready ciklus leta/poniščevanja."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Bearing difference"
msgstr "Razlika v smerih"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Brng D"
msgstr "Zahodni uhel"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Difference between the glider's track (direction of motion across the "
"ground) and the bearing to the next waypoint, or for AAT tasks, the bearing "
"to the target within the AAT sector. GPS navigation is based on the track, "
"and the track may differ from the glider's heading when there is wind. "
"Chevrons point to the direction the glider needs to alter course to correct "
"the bearing difference, that is, to make it so that the glider is tracking "
"directly toward the next waypoint. This calculation accounts for the "
"curvature of the Earth."
msgstr ""
"Razlika med smerjo poti letala (smer poteze po zemlji) in smerjo do nasledne "
"točke, ali za naloge AAT, smerjo do cilja v AAT sektorju. GPS navigacija je "
"opremljena s smerjo, in ta smer lahko razlikuje od smeri letala, če obstaja "
"vetar. Štirikotniki pokazujejo smer, v katero mora letalo preurediti pot za "
"izpraznilo razlike v smerih, to je, da se letalo sledi direktno proti "
"nasledni točki. Ta izračun upravičeno uvaža krivljenje Zemlje."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Outside air temperature"
msgstr "Temperatura vzdušja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "OAT"
msgstr "OAT"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Outside air temperature measured by a probe if supported by a connected "
"intelligent variometer."
msgstr ""
"Temperatura vzdušja merjena z vrteljem, če je podprta povezanim "
"inteligentnim variometerjem."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Relative humidity"
msgstr "Relativna vlaga"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Rel Hum"
msgstr "Zaslišljiva vlažnost"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Relative humidity of the air in percent as measured by a probe if supported "
"by a connected intelligent variometer."
msgstr ""
"Relativna vlaga vzdušja v procentih, merjena z vrteljem, če je podprta "
"povezanim inteligentnim variometerjem."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Max Temp"
msgstr "Maksimalna temperatura"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Forecast temperature of the ground at the home airfield, used in estimating "
"convection height and cloud base in conjunction with outside air temperature "
"and relative humidity probe. (Touch-screen/PC only) Pressing the up/down "
"cursor keys adjusts this forecast temperature."
msgstr ""
"Prognozirana temperatura podloge na domačem letališču, uporabljena za oceno "
"višine konvekcije in podnebi v zvezi s zunanjim atmosferskim temperaturem in "
"umikom relativne vlage. (Prestavljeno/PC leto) Pritisnite gumbe za povečanje "
"ali zmanjšanje, da se spremeni ta prognozirana temperatura."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT distance around target"
msgstr "AAT razdalja okoli cilja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Dtgt"
msgstr "AAT Dtgta"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigned Area Task distance around target points for remainder of task."
msgstr ""
"Razdalja pod nalogo za označeno območje okoli točk cilja za preostal del "
"naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT speed around target"
msgstr "AAT hitrost okoli cilja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Vtgt"
msgstr "AAT Vtgta"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assigned Area Task average speed achievable around target points remaining "
"in minimum AAT time."
msgstr ""
"Preravnan splošna hitrost okoli točk cilja, ki se je še zmanjšalo v "
"najmanjši čas AAT."

#, no-c-format
msgid "L/D vario"
msgstr "L/D variometer"

#, no-c-format
msgid "L/D Vario"
msgstr "L/D Variometer"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous lift/drag ratio, given by the indicated airspeed divided by "
"the total energy vertical speed, when connected to an intelligent "
"variometer. Negative values indicate climbing cruise. If the total energy "
"vario speed is close to zero, the displayed value is '---'."
msgstr ""
"Momentni vzletno/povrnito odnos, dano s hitrostjo letalne površine podane s "
"povezanim inteligentnim variometrom. Negativna vrednost pomeni vzletno "
"kroženje. Če je hitrost energije znotraj varijom blizu ničemu, prikazana "
"vrednost je '---'."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airspeed TAS"
msgstr "Hitrost letalne površine TAS"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V TAS"
msgstr "V POMS"

#, no-c-format
msgid "True Airspeed reported by a supported external intelligent vario."
msgstr ""
"Pravilna hitrost letalne površine, izpisana podprtenim zunanjim "
"inteligentnim variometrom."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team code"
msgstr "Koda ekipi"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Current Team code for this aircraft. Use this to report to other team "
"members. The last team aircraft code entered is displayed underneath."
msgstr ""
"Trenutna koda ekipi za to letalo. Uporabite ta kod in oznake, da se "
"odposlujate drugim članom ekipy. Prikazana je zadnja vstavljena koda "
"ekipnega letala."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team bearing"
msgstr "Koder ekipa"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team Brng"
msgstr "Koder ekipa"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Bearing to the team aircraft location at the last team code report."
msgstr ""
"Zahodni kot do položaja letalne ekipi, ki se je odposlalo z zadnjim kodom "
"ekipnega letala."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team bearing difference"
msgstr "Razlika v koderu ekipa"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team BrngD"
msgstr "Sama ekipne skupine"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Relative bearing to the team aircraft location at the last reported team "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Ustavni kot vzhodnega člana ekipne skupine na zadnjem oznakovanem kodom "
"ekipne skupine."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team range"
msgstr "Odleglosc ekipne skupine"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team Dist"
msgstr "Odleglosc do ekipne skupine"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Range to the team aircraft location at the last reported team code."
msgstr "Odleglosc do ekipne skupine v zadnjem oznakovanem kodu ekipne skupine."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed task instantaneous"
msgstr "Hitrost naloge trenutna"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V Task Inst"
msgstr "V hitrosti naloge instancirana"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous cross-country speed while on current task, compensated for "
"altitude. Equivalent to instantaneous Pirker cross-country speed."
msgstr "Povprečna hitrost na trenutni nalogi, brez kompenzacije višine."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance home"
msgstr "Domet domov"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Home Dist"
msgstr "Domovska odleglosc"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance to home waypoint (if defined)."
msgstr "Odleglosc do točke poti domov (če je definirano)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed task achieved"
msgstr "Hitrost naloge dosežena"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V Task Ach"
msgstr "V hitrosti naloge dosežena"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Achieved cross-country speed while on current task, compensated for "
"altitude. Equivalent to Pirker cross-country speed remaining."
msgstr "Povprečna hitrost na trenutni nalogi, brez kompenzacije višine."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT delta time"
msgstr "Delta čas AAT"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT dT"
msgstr "Delta čas AAT"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Difference between estimated task time and AAT minimum time. Coloured red if "
"negative (expected arrival too early), or blue if in sector and can turn now "
"with estimated arrival time greater than AAT time plus 5 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Razlika med ocenjenim časom za završek naloge in minimalnim časom AAT. "
"Barvna v tem primeru rdečo, če je negativno (predvideni prihodek "
"premišljen), ali modro, če je v sektorju in lahko sprostimo zgoraj z "
"ocenjenim prihodom, ki je večji od časa AATa z dodatnim časom 5 minut."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal average over all"
msgstr "Prerast termik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "T Avg"
msgstr "Povprečna temperatura termik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time-average climb rate in all thermals."
msgstr "V času povprečna vzletnica v vseh termikih."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task req. total height trend"
msgstr "Zahtevana visinska trend naloge"

#, no-c-format
msgid "RH Trend"
msgstr "Trend relativne visine"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Trend (or neg. of the variation) of the total required height to complete "
"the task."
msgstr "Trend (ali negativna varijacija) zahtevane višine za zaključek naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Battery percent"
msgstr "Šola električne sile"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Percentage of device battery remaining (where applicable) and status/voltage "
"of external power supply."
msgstr ""
"Odstotek preostale električne sile urede in stanje/napetost dodatnega "
"vedenja (pri upravljavi)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final GR"
msgstr "Končno drsno razmerje"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin GR"
msgstr "Končni drs"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Required glide ratio over ground to finish the task, given by the distance "
"to go divided by the height required to arrive at the safety arrival height."
msgstr ""
"Zahtevano drsno razmerje po zemlji, da zaključimo nalogo, določeno s "
"razdaljo do cilja deljeno z zahtevano višino do varnostne višine pri "
"dolgoletnem pristanek."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternate 1"
msgstr "Alternativa 1"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altn 1"
msgstr "Vrh 1"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Name and bearing to the best alternate landing location."
msgstr "Ime in smernica najboljše alternativne lokacije za pristanek."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternate 2"
msgstr "Alternativa 2"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altn 2"
msgstr "Vrh 2"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Name and bearing to the second-best alternate landing location."
msgstr "Ime in smernica drugo najboljše alternativne lokacije za pristanek."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternate 1 GR"
msgstr "Alternativa 1 drsno razmerje"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altn 1 GR"
msgstr "Altn 1 drsno razmerje"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Geometric gradient to the arrival height above the best alternate landing location. This is not adjusted for total energy."
msgstr "Geometrijska nagiba do varnostne višine na najboljši alternativni lokaciji za pristanek. To ni dostosovano za celotno energijo."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Height above take-off"
msgstr "Višina od vzletnega točka"

#, no-c-format
msgid "H T/O"
msgstr "H O/P"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Height based on an automatic take-off reference elevation (like a QFE reference)."
msgstr "Višina glede na avtomatsko referenčno višino pri vzletu (npr. QFE)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "GR average"
msgstr "Prosek drsnega razmerja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "GR Avg"
msgstr "GR Prosek"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance flown during the configured averaging period divided by the altitude lost during that period. Negative values are shown as ^^^ and indicate climbing cruise (height gain). For GR >200, the value is shown as +++. You can configure the averaging period in the system setup (suggested: 60, 90 or 120s). Lower values will be closer to GR Inst, and higher values will be closer to GR Cruise. Note: The distance is not the straight line between your previous and current positions; it is the actual path distance flown (including zigzags). This value is not calculated while circling."
msgstr "Razdalja leta v postavljeno srednjo obdobje deljena z izgubljenimi višinami v tem istem obdobju. Negativne vrednosti so prikazane kot ^^^ in pomenijo klimanjeno kroženje (višinsko zmago). Če je GR > 200, ta vrednost je prikazana kot +++. Možno je nastaviti srednjo obdobje v sistemskih nastavitvah (pogostek: 60, 90 ali 120s). Nizke vrednosti so bližje GR Inst, a viške vrednosti so bližje GR Cruise. Opomba: Razdalja ni pravila povezana s prejšnjim in trenutnim položajem; je dejanska razdalja leta (vključno z zigažagami). Ta vrednost se ne izračuna, ko se kroži."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Experimental 1"
msgstr "Ekperiment 1"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Exp1"
msgstr "Poligrafska črta"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Contest distance"
msgstr "Naslednja razdalja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Cont Dist"
msgstr "Fin Raz"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Instantaneous evaluation of the flown distance according to the configured Contest rule set."
msgstr "Okrajšana ocena pretežkega leta glede na nastavljeno pravilo za tekmovanje."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Experimental 2"
msgstr "Ekperiment 2"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Exp2"
msgstr "Pogosto"

#, no-c-format
msgid "CPU load"
msgstr "CPU nivo uporabnega obroka"

#, no-c-format
msgid "CPU"
msgstr "CPU"

#, no-c-format
msgid "CPU load consumed by XCSoar averaged over 5 seconds."
msgstr "Procentni nivo uporabnega CPU obroka XCSoar-ja povprečen v 5 sekundah."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next altitude arrival"
msgstr "Naslednja dosežena višina"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP AltA"
msgstr "WP VišA"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Absolute arrival altitude at the next waypoint in final glide. For AAT tasks, the target within the AAT sector is used."
msgstr "Višina ob prihodu na naslednjo obratno točko relativna na varnostno višino. Za AAT naloge je v uporabi tarčna točka v AAT območju."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Free RAM"
msgstr "Slobodno pomnilnik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Free RAM as reported by OS."
msgstr "Slobodno pomnilnik kot je izvedeno operacijsko sistema."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Flight level"
msgstr "Letna višina"

#, no-c-format
msgid "FL"
msgstr "FL"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Pressure Altitude given as Flight Level. If barometric altitude is not available, FL is calculated from GPS altitude, given that the correct QNH is set. In case the FL is calculated from the GPS altitude, the FL label is coloured red."
msgstr "Nastouščna višina podano kot Vlakno leta (Flight Level). Če je barometrična višina neprimerljiva, je FL izračunana iz GPS više, če je nastavljena prava QNH. Če je FL izračunano iz GPS više, je oznaka FL barva rdeča."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Barogram"
msgstr "Barografski zapisnik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Trace of altitude during flight."
msgstr "Trajektorija višine po letu."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Vario trace"
msgstr "Vario traja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Vario Trace"
msgstr "Vario Traja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Trace of vertical speed, as reported by the GPS, or the intelligent vario total energy vario value if connected to one."
msgstr "Trajektorija vertikalne hitrosti, kot je izvedeno z GPS-a ali inteligentnim variom totalno energijsko vrednostjo, če je povezan s tem."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Netto vario trace"
msgstr "Netto vario traja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Netto Trace"
msgstr "Netni sporočilnik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Trace of vertical speed of air-mass, equal to vario value less the glider's estimated sink rate."
msgstr "Sporočilnik za vertikalno hitrost tokov, enak varijometrijskemu vrednosti manjši z očitano padajoče hitrostjo jadrila."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal climb trace"
msgstr "Sporočilnik termičnega vzvajanja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC Trace"
msgstr "TC sporočilnik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Trace of average climb rate each turn in circling, based of the reported GPS altitude, or vario if available."
msgstr "Sporočilnik priznavane vzvajalne hitrosti v okoliščih, narejeno na podlagi izpisane GPS višine ali varijometrija, če je dostopna."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Climb band"
msgstr "Plošča vzvajanja"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Climb Band"
msgstr "PLOŠČA VZVAJANJA"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Graph of average circling climb rate (horizontal axis) as a function of altitude (vertical axis)."
msgstr "Graf priznavane vzvajalne hitrosti v okoliščih (os horizontalno) kot funkcija višine (os vertikalno)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task progress"
msgstr "Naloga"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Progress"
msgstr "Postopak"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Clock-like display of distance remaining along task, showing achieved task points."
msgstr "Svetlo zasliško za preostalno razdaljo po nalogi, prikazuje dosežene točke naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time under max. start height"
msgstr "Čas pod maksimalno začetno višino"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start Height"
msgstr "Začetna višina"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Contiguous period during which the aircraft has been below the task start maximum height."
msgstr "Natančen čas, v katerem je letalka bil pod maksimalno začetno višino."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task time to go (ground speed)"
msgstr "Čas do konca naloge (površinska hitrost)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin ETE VMG"
msgstr "Končni ETE VMG"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Estimated time required to complete task, assuming current ground speed is maintained."
msgstr "Ocena časa potrebnega za dokončanje naloge, predpostavljeno manjšo površinsko hitrost."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next time to go (ground speed)"
msgstr "Naslednji čas do konca (površinska hitrost)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP ETE VMG"
msgstr "TOČKA POTI ETE VMG"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Estimated time required to reach next waypoint, assuming current ground speed is maintained."
msgstr "Ocena časa potrebnega za dosego naslednjega točke poti, predpostavljeno manjšo površinsko hitrost."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Attitude indicator"
msgstr "Attitudska oznaka"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Attitude indicator (artificial horizon) display calculated from flight path, supplemented with acceleration and variometer data if available."
msgstr "Prikaz artifisnalne horizontale izračunana iz letne poti, dopolnjen s podatki iz variometra, če so na voljo."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest airspace horizontal"
msgstr "najbližji zračni prostor vodoravno"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Near AS H"
msgstr "Blizu AS H"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Horizontal distance to the nearest airspace."
msgstr "Vodoravna razdalja do najbližjega zračnega prostore."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest airspace vertical"
msgstr "najbližji zračni prostor navpično"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Near AS V"
msgstr "Blizu AS V"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Vertical distance to the nearest airspace. A positive value means the airspace is above you; a negative value means the airspace is below you."
msgstr "Navpična razdalja do najbližjega zračnega prostore. Pozitivna vrednost pomeni, da je zračni prostor zgornje; negativna vrednost pomeni, da je zračni prostor spodnje."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next MC0 altitude difference"
msgstr "Nastavitev MC0 visinska razlika"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP MC0 AltD"
msgstr "TOČK MC0 VrhD"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Arrival altitude at the next waypoint with MC 0 setting relative to the safety arrival height. For AAT tasks, the target within the AAT sector is used."
msgstr "Višina ob prihodu na naslednjo obratno točko relativna na varnostno višino. Za AAT naloge je v uporabi tarčna točka v AAT območju."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind, head component"
msgstr "Vjeterski komponenta smeri"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Head Wind"
msgstr "Glavni vjetar"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Current head wind component. Head wind is calculated from TAS and GPS ground speed if airspeed is available from an external device; otherwise, the estimated wind is used."
msgstr "Trenutna komponenta glavnega vjetra. Glavni vjetar izračunava se iz TAS in GPS zemljevidne hitrosti, če je letnica dostopna iz vnorenega naprave; sicer se uporablja ocenjen vjetar."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terrain collision"
msgstr "Zračno kolizija"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terr Coll"
msgstr "ZRC Coll"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance to the next terrain collision along the current task leg. At this location, the altitude will be below the configured terrain clearance altitude."
msgstr "Razdalja do naslednjega zračnega kolizija na trenutnem delu naloge. V tej lokaciji bo visina spodnje od konfigurirane vrednosti začasne visine."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altitude (Auto)"
msgstr "Visina (Automatika)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alt Auto"
msgstr "Vis Auto"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Barometric altitude obtained from a device equipped with a pressure sensor, or GPS altitude if barometric altitude is not available."
msgstr "Barometrična visina, ki jo prejme naprava z opremo za senzor tlaka, ali GPS visina, če barometrična visina ni na voljo."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal next leg equivalent"
msgstr "Termično enakovrednost naslednjega lega"

#, no-c-format
msgid "T Next Leg"
msgstr "T Naslednja stopa"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal climb rate on the next leg that is equivalent to a thermal climb rate equal to the MacCready setting on the current leg."
msgstr "Povezanost termike na naslednjem stopu enakovrnih s povezanostjo termike na trenutnem stopu, ki je nastavljena z MacCready postavko."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind, head component (simplified)"
msgstr "Vjeterni komponent (simplificiran)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Head Wind *"
msgstr "Prednjiv vjetar *"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Current head wind component. The simplified head wind is calculated by subtracting GPS ground speed from TAS if airspeed is available from an external device."
msgstr "Trenutni prednjiv vjetarski komponent. Simplificirani prednjiv vjetar se izračuna odštevkom GPS podnožne hitrosti od težnje, če je hitrost z mesta dostopna iz vnorskega naprave."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task cruise efficiency"
msgstr "Učinkovitost leta na poti"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Cruise Eff"
msgstr "Eff Cru"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Efficiency of cruise. 100 indicates perfect MacCready performance. This value estimates your cruise efficiency according to the current flight history with the set MC value. Calculation begins after task is started."
msgstr "Učinkovitost leta na poti. Vrednost 100 pomeni idealno MacCready vodilnico. Ta vrednost ocenjuje vašo učinkovitost na poti glede trenutne letne zgodovine s nastavljeno MC vrednostjo. Izračun se začne po začetku naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Circular thermal assistant that shows the lift distribution over each part of the circle."
msgstr "Pomočna termika, ki prikazuje distribucijo vzdušnega povezanosti po vsakem delu kroga."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start open/close countdown"
msgstr "Začni odpiranje/zapiranje časovnice"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start open"
msgstr "Začni odpiranje"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start open/close countdown at reaching"
msgstr "Začni odpiranje/zapiranje časovnice pri dosegu"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start reach"
msgstr "Začni doseg"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next radial"
msgstr "Naslednji radijal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "True bearing from the next waypoint to your position."
msgstr "Istina vodoravni kot od naslednjega poti do vaše položaje."

#, no-c-format
msgid "ATC radial"
msgstr "ATC radijal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Bearing from the selected reference location to your position. The distance is displayed in nautical miles for communication with ATC. If declination is entered, magnetic bearing is given to match VOR radials."
msgstr "Vodoravni kot od izbranega referenčnega mesta do vaše položaje. Razdalja je prikazana v nautičnih miljah za komunikacijo z ATC. Če je vneseno odklikanje, je podano magnetno vodoravni kot, da se prilagodi VOR radijalom."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed task last hour"
msgstr "Hitrost zadnjega ura leta"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V Task H"
msgstr "V zadnji zadanki"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Average cross-country speed while on current task over the last hour, not compensated for altitude."
msgstr "Povprečna hitrost na trenutni nalogi, brez kompenzacije višine."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next distance (nominal)"
msgstr "Naslednja razdalja (pogon)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP Dist-N"
msgstr "Razdalja do WP-N"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance to the currently selected waypoint. For AAT tasks, this is the distance to the origin of the AAT sector."
msgstr "Razdalja do trenutno izbrane točke. Za naloge AAT je to točka do izbrane tarče v območju AAT."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Circle diameter"
msgstr "Ženski krog"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Circle D"
msgstr "Okrog D"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Circle diameter. Displays estimated circle diameter and full circle flight time. Useful for evaluating best thermalling mode with a glider at different wing loading."
msgstr "Razdalja od leta. Prikaže razdaljo do mesta, kjer je bil zaznan leta."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance takeoff"
msgstr "Razdalja za vzlet"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Takeoff Dist"
msgstr "Razdalja za vzlet"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance to where take-off was detected."
msgstr "Razdalja do mesta, kjer je bil zaznan vzlet."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Contest speed"
msgstr "Spremna hitrost"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Cont Speed"
msgstr "Hitrost s"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Instantaneous evaluation of the flown speed according to the configured contest rule set."
msgstr "Okrajšana ocena letne hitrosti glede na nastavljeno pravilo za kompetencijo."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final MC0 altitude difference"
msgstr "Končna razlika v višini MC0"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin MC0 AltD"
msgstr "Končna MC0 višinska razlika"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Arrival altitude at the final waypoint with MC 0 setting relative to the safety arrival height."
msgstr "Višina pri končni točki s nastavkom MC 0 relativno do varne pristankovne višine."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next arrow"
msgstr "Naslednja začetna točka"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Arrow pointing to the currently selected waypoint. The name of the waypoint and the distance are also shown. The position used is the optimized position of the active waypoint in the current task, the center of a selected goto waypoint or the target within the AAT sector for AAT tasks."
msgstr "Ustreznih ukaz za trenutno izbrano točko poti. Imenuje se tudi točka poti in razdalja. Uporabljena pozicija je optimizirana pozicija aktivne točke poti v trenutnem zadanku, središče izbrane točke za vzpostavitev ali cilj v AAT sektorju za AAT zadank."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next waypoint arrival time (ground speed)"
msgstr "Predviđen čas prihodnje točke (pogonska hitrost)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP ETA VMG"
msgstr "Točka poti ETA VMG"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Estimated arrival time at next waypoint, assuming current ground speed is maintained."
msgstr "Predvideni čas prihodne točke, predpostavljeno, da se ohranja trenutna pogonska hitrost."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Percentage non-circling climb"
msgstr "Odstotek nekroličnega vzletnega stanka"

#, no-c-format
msgid "% Str Climb"
msgstr "% Sprememb str. sticena"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Percentage of time spent climbing without circling. These statistics are reset upon starting the task."
msgstr "Odstotek časa, ki je potrošen za stajanje brez okrivanja. Te statistike se ponovno zacnejo po začetku naloge."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Percentage climb chart"
msgstr "Stijanska karta odstotkov"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Climb %"
msgstr "Stijanski %"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Pie chart of time circling and climbing, circling and descending, and climbing non-circling."
msgstr "Kupna kmetija časa okrivanja in stajanja, okrivanja in padanjega ter stajanja brez okrivanja."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of used satellites"
msgstr "Stevilo uporabljnih satelitov"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Satellites"
msgstr "Sateliti"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of satellites currently used by the GPS module. If this information is unavailable, the displayed value is '---'."
msgstr "Stevilo satelitov trenutno uporabljenih z GPS modulom. Če je ta informacija nedostopna, prikazana vrednost je '---'."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Active Radio Frequency"
msgstr "Aktiven radijski frekvenčni kanal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Act Freq"
msgstr "Aktivna frekv."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Active radio frequency."
msgstr "Aktiven radijski frekvenčni kanal."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Standby Radio Frequency"
msgstr "Standby radijski frekvenčni kanal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Stby Freq"
msgstr "Rezervna frekv."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Standby radio frequency."
msgstr "Standby radijski frekvenčni kanal."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal time"
msgstr "Dobitek višine"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC Time"
msgstr "TC čas"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time spent in the current thermal."
msgstr "Višina, pridobljena/izgubljena v trenutnem dviganju."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternate 2 GR"
msgstr "Alternativna 2 GR"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altn 2 GR"
msgstr "Vtični višinski nivo DR"

